                                               moves 112·w·h + 10·B·w             if ≈ 16·h < M and ≈ 24·h ≥ M and 2·B·w < M
                 lower bound      moves 32·w·h                       (footprint, every distinct element crosses once)   gap 10× if ≈ 24·h < M and 2·B·w ≥ M; 10× if ≈ 16·h ≥ M and 2·B·w ≥ M; 4× if ≈ 24·h < M and 2·B·w < M; 4× if ≈ 16·h ≥ M and 2·B·w < M; 10× if ≈ 16·h < M and ≈ 24·h ≥ M and 2·B·w ≥ M; 4× if ≈ 16·h < M and ≈ 24·h ≥ M and 2·B·w < M at M = 2 MiB, B = 64
                 footprint        img_in: [0, 8·w·h)  img_out: [0, 8·w·h)  y1: [0, 8·w·h)  y2: [0, 8·w·h)   resident after if 32·w·h < M
                 rests on         exp (declared, extern); pow (declared, extern)
